WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.332 --> 00:00:12.841
"Look out!"

2
00:00:13.341 --> 00:00:14.082
someone yelled.

3
00:00:15.163 --> 00:00:17.905
The voice sounded like Julia's, but Brody wasn't sure.

4
00:00:18.906 --> 00:00:22.328
He couldn't take his eyes off the huge snake flying toward his face.

5
00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:27.713
Its mouth was wide open, and its fangs looked huge and razor-sharp.

6
00:00:28.773 --> 00:00:31.656
A sickly yellow liquid dripped from the pointy ends.

7
00:00:32.684 --> 00:00:39.108
Beside Brody, Apollo's champion stood frozen in place, staring at the snakes with a terrified look on his

8
00:00:39.168 --> 00:00:42.549
face. Brody wasn't afraid of snakes.

9
00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:47.532
He'd even kept one as a pet for a while until he'd forgotten to put the lid back

10
00:00:47.612 --> 00:00:49.193
on the tank and it had escaped.

11
00:00:50.294 --> 00:00:52.235
But he didn't like the look of these snakes.

12
00:00:53.395 --> 00:00:55.897
Especially with that stuff dripping from the fangs.

13
00:00:55.917 --> 00:01:03.633
"Duck!" he yelled, leaping sideways and tackling the other athlete, who was still just standing there like a

14
00:01:03.673 --> 00:01:06.914
dope. Both boys tumbled to the ground.

15
00:01:07.674 --> 00:01:10.014
The snakes flew over them, hissing loudly.

16
00:01:11.075 --> 00:01:13.836
Then came the sound of loud, cackling laughter.

17
00:01:16.917 --> 00:01:20.338
As he sat up, Brody saw Ares striding toward them.

18
00:01:20.358 --> 00:01:24.199
"It seems you did find a good champion, Hermes!"

19
00:01:24.739 --> 00:01:25.619
Ares declared.

20
00:01:25.639 --> 00:01:28.200
"You're quick, boy."

21
00:01:29.472 --> 00:01:34.273
He bent down and clapped Brody on the back so hard that Brody almost fell over again.

22
00:01:35.554 --> 00:01:38.395
Brody stared at him for a second and then laughed.

23
00:01:38.415 --> 00:01:41.495
"Thanks, dude," he said.

24
00:01:41.515 --> 00:01:43.856
"That snake thing was cool.

25
00:01:44.436 --> 00:01:46.017
Can all you gods do stuff like that?"

26
00:01:47.537 --> 00:01:52.198
By then Hermes and Apollo had run over to the boys, along with Julia and Markos.

27
00:01:52.218 --> 00:01:54.699
"Are you all right, Brody?"

28
00:01:55.199 --> 00:01:57.720
Markos asked, his face pale and anxious.

29
00:01:58.496 --> 00:01:59.337
"That was close!"

30
00:02:00.978 --> 00:02:03.360
"Yes." Hermes scowled at Ares.

31
00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:05.282
"A little too close."

32
00:02:06.803 --> 00:02:07.383
"I'm fine."

33
00:02:07.864 --> 00:02:09.165
Brody jumped to his feet.

34
00:02:09.185 --> 00:02:10.806
"No big deal.

35
00:02:10.826 --> 00:02:11.727
It was just a joke."

36
00:02:13.048 --> 00:02:15.570
"A joke that could have killed you," Julia said.

37
00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:18.092
"I'm guessing those snakes are venomous."

38
00:02:19.513 --> 00:02:22.435
"Oh, they are," Ares said with a smirk.

39
00:02:23.316 --> 00:02:24.677
"Extremely venomous."

40
00:02:26.278 --> 00:02:27.039
Brody shrugged.

41
00:02:28.076 --> 00:02:29.136
"Okay. But they didn't bite us.

42
00:02:29.556 --> 00:02:30.917
Like I said, no big deal."

43
00:02:32.097 --> 00:02:34.018
Apollo was glaring at Ares too.

44
00:02:34.038 --> 00:02:38.539
"It might be a big deal if it happens again," he snapped.

45
00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:41.580
"Is that a threat, sun god?"

46
00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:44.381
Suddenly Ares' smile disappeared.

47
00:02:45.561 --> 00:02:49.082
He clenched his fists and stuck his face in the other god's face.

48
00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:54.903
"I don't make threats," Apollo retorted, his eyes flashing with fury.

49
00:02:54.923 --> 00:02:56.744
"I take action."

50
00:02:57.972 --> 00:02:59.273
"Boys, boys."

51
00:02:59.873 --> 00:03:03.035
Artemis strolled over, looking amused by the gods' bickering.

52
00:03:03.055 --> 00:03:08.099
"You're taking this far too seriously," she said.

53
00:03:08.119 --> 00:03:12.742
"Shouldn't we all be saving our best tricks for Zeus' champion?"

54
00:03:12.762 --> 00:03:17.685
"Don't tell me what to do, sister," Apollo muttered.

55
00:03:18.626 --> 00:03:21.668
But he took a step back from Ares and looked less angry.

56
00:03:23.489 --> 00:03:27.712
As the gods continued bickering with each other, Julia pulled Brody away.

57
00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:35.562
"No matter what the gods say, Alcides obviously isn't their only target," she whispered.

58
00:03:35.582 --> 00:03:41.163
"Markos told me the gods constantly try to sabotage each others' champions.

59
00:03:41.583 --> 00:03:42.904
Now are you ready to escape?

60
00:03:43.304 --> 00:03:44.844
It's not exactly safe for you."

61
00:03:45.965 --> 00:03:47.405
Brody shook off her hand.

62
00:03:47.425 --> 00:03:50.646
"Don't be such a wimp," he said.

63
00:03:50.666 --> 00:03:53.967
"Like I said, it was just a prank.

64
00:03:54.227 --> 00:03:57.308
My teammates and I do stuff like that all the time in the locker room."

65
00:03:58.740 --> 00:04:00.942
"You throw deadly reptiles at each other?"

66
00:04:01.483 --> 00:04:02.904
Julia said sarcastically.

67
00:04:04.165 --> 00:04:04.946
Brody shrugged.

68
00:04:04.966 --> 00:04:08.349
"Why is she making such a big deal about this?"

69
00:04:08.889 --> 00:04:09.389
he thought.

70
00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:11.872
He could handle a few pranks.

71
00:04:13.813 --> 00:04:17.637
If he couldn't handle them, he'd never survive being on the football team back home!

72
00:04:20.099 --> 00:04:22.321
Hermes hurried over, still looking annoyed.

73
00:04:22.341 --> 00:04:25.864
"Back to work, boy," he told Brody.

74
00:04:27.072 --> 00:04:29.994
"We must show Ares that his ridiculous stunt hasn't rattled you.

75
00:04:30.354 --> 00:04:32.236
Grab another javelin and let's try again."

76
00:04:33.337 --> 00:04:36.199
Hermes worked Brody hard for the next couple of hours.

77
00:04:37.019 --> 00:04:40.942
Finally, after a particularly fast sprint, Hermes smiled.

78
00:04:40.962 --> 00:04:43.564
"Well done," he said.

79
00:04:43.584 --> 00:04:45.305
"That's enough for today.

80
00:04:46.026 --> 00:04:47.547
I have other business to attend to.

81
00:04:47.947 --> 00:04:50.449
Go wash up, and then Markos will take you home."

82
00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:54.652
Markos pointed Brody toward a bathing chamber nearby.

83
00:04:56.048 --> 00:05:01.953
Brody was dismayed to find only a bare room with a mosaic floor, a stone tub, and no

84
00:05:02.013 --> 00:05:03.034
warm water at all.

85
00:05:04.275 --> 00:05:08.479
Still, it was a very hot day, and the cool water felt pretty good.

86
00:05:10.060 --> 00:05:13.122
He rinsed off the sweat and wrapped a towel around himself.

87
00:05:14.323 --> 00:05:17.346
As he reached for his grungy chiton, the door opened.

88
00:05:17.366 --> 00:05:19.548
"Excuse me!"

89
00:05:19.968 --> 00:05:21.649
Brody started to call out a warning.

90
00:05:24.996 --> 00:05:27.798
"I'm—oh!" Brody gulped as Aphrodite slipped into the room.

91
00:05:27.818 --> 00:05:32.260
"Greetings, Brody," the goddess of beauty purred.

92
00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:37.023
"I was very impressed with your training today."

93
00:05:37.043 --> 00:05:40.424
"You you were?"

94
00:05:40.845 --> 00:05:41.505
Brody said.

95
00:05:42.386 --> 00:05:43.546
His face flushed.

96
00:05:44.867 --> 00:05:46.348
"I didn't even know you were watching."

97
00:05:47.608 --> 00:05:49.209
Smiling, she came closer.

98
00:05:49.229 --> 00:05:53.952
"Oh, I was watching," she said.

99
00:05:55.052 --> 00:06:00.416
"Would you do me the honor of taking a stroll with me and explaining how you came to

100
00:06:00.476 --> 00:06:02.858
be so fast and strong?"

101
00:06:02.878 --> 00:06:05.900
"Sure!" Brody blurted out.

102
00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:08.962
"I mean, yeah, that sounds cool.

103
00:06:09.182 --> 00:06:11.724
Whatever." "Wonderful."

104
00:06:12.344 --> 00:06:13.585
Aphrodite beamed at him.

105
00:06:14.706 --> 00:06:17.047
Then she pulled something from behind her back.

106
00:06:18.168 --> 00:06:19.449
"Here's a fresh chiton.

107
00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.410
Why don't you put it on?

108
00:06:22.031 --> 00:06:23.412
I'll wait for you outside."

109
00:06:24.964 --> 00:06:25.564
"Uh, thanks."

110
00:06:26.024 --> 00:06:29.445
Brody took the garment, hardly believing that this was happening.

111
00:06:30.426 --> 00:06:32.826
Back home, he'd never even had a girlfriend yet.

112
00:06:33.827 --> 00:06:38.468
But here in ancient Greece, an actual goddess was practically throwing herself at him!

113
00:06:39.608 --> 00:06:42.909
Being an Olympic athlete was even more awesome than Brody had expected.

114
00:06:42.929 --> 00:06:47.791
"Don't be long, mortal champion," Aphrodite said with a wink.

115
00:06:47.811 --> 00:06:52.172
"I'm really looking forward to our stroll."

116
00:06:53.936 --> 00:06:56.018
As she headed for the door, it opened again.

117
00:06:57.358 --> 00:06:59.000
This time Athena looked in.

118
00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:03.082
"There you are," Athena said to Aphrodite.

119
00:07:03.102 --> 00:07:05.744
"I've been looking for you.

120
00:07:06.264 --> 00:07:10.467
I heard that you and Hera were seen—" Her gray eyes suddenly went wide.

121
00:07:10.487 --> 00:07:12.649
"Drop that garment, boy!"

122
00:07:13.149 --> 00:07:13.870
she commanded.

123
00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:16.371
"Huh?" Brody said.

124
00:07:16.391 --> 00:07:22.956
"Why?" Athena reached him in three long strides and snatched the chiton out of his hands.

125
00:07:24.092 --> 00:07:25.034
"I said drop it!"

126
00:07:25.515 --> 00:07:26.096
she shouted.

127
00:07:26.116 --> 00:07:27.659
"It's poisoned!"
